[{"id":181534255,"discussion_id":"2da82460e870d5dd62513dc93812ce1d22ea906c","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `threshold_grad_v2_d` 算子在 int8/uint8 数据类型下的精度问题。核心改动是新增了一个专用 DAG 结构体 `ThresholdGradV2D8BDag`，在 int8/uint8 与 float 之间的类型转换中引入 `half`（fp16）作为中间格式，避免直接转换带来的精度损失，并在 Tiling 和 Kernel 层将 int8/uint8 分支从原有的 `ThresholdGradV2DDag` 切换到新的 `ThresholdGradV2D8BDag`。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `ThresholdGradV2D8BDag` 结构体**：在 `threshold_grad_v2_d_dag.h` 中新增了一个模板 DAG 结构，将 int8/uint8 输入先通过 `Vec::Cast` 转为 `half`、再转为 `float`，经过 `Compare` 和 `Select` 运算后，再依次转回 `half` 和原始类型 `U`，以中间格式 `half` 替代了直接与 `float` 互转的方式。\n- **Tiling 层切换 int8/uint8 分支**：在 `threshold_grad_v2_d_tiling_arch35.cpp` 中，将 `DT_INT8` 和 `DT_UINT8` 分支的模板参数从 `ThresholdGradV2DDag` 改为 `ThresholdGradV2D8BDag`，确保 tiling 阶段使用新的精度优化路径。\n- **Kernel 层切换 int8/uint8 分支**：在 `threshold_grad_v2_d.cpp` 中，将 `THRESHOLD_GRAD_V2_D_TPL_INT8` 和 `THRESHOLD_GRAD_V2_D_TPL_UINT8` 分支的 `BroadcastSch` 模板参数从 `ThresholdGradV2DDag` 改为 `ThresholdGradV2D8BDag`，使实际运算执行新的转换链路。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-24T15:54:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-24T16:01:19+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181534259,"discussion_id":"f3185f5a65d900de6495ddf232707cef71a88ee1","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n## 审查结论\n\n经过对全部 3 个变更文件的逐行审查：\n\n- **`activation/threshold_grad_v2_d/op_kernel/arch35/threshold_grad_v2_d_dag.h`**：新增的 `ThresholdGradV2D8BDag` 模板通过 half（fp16）作为中间精度进行 int8/uint8 ↔ float 的两步转换，数据流设计正确，与原始 `ThresholdGradV2DDag` 的模式一致，无问题。\n\n- **`activation/threshold_grad_v2_d/op_kernel/threshold_grad_v2_d.cpp`**：kernel 侧 int8/uint8 分支正确切换为 `ThresholdGradV2D8BDag`，与其他 dtype 分支的调度模式一致，无问题。\n\n- **`activation/threshold_grad_v2_d/op_host/arch35/threshold_grad_v2_d_tiling_arch35.cpp`**：tiling 侧模板已正确切换，但 int8 和 uint8 两个分支的错误日志消息未同步更新（第 101 行和第 109 行），仍引用旧的 `ThresholdGradV2DDag` 模板名。\n\n### 问题汇总\n\n| 优先级 | 数量 |\n|--------|------|\n| P0 | 0 |\n| P1 | 0 |\n| P2 | 0 |\n| P3 | 2 |\n\n**整体风险评估：低。** 两个 P3 问题仅为日志消息的复制粘贴疏忽，不影响运行时正确性和精度修复的有效性。建议在合入前修正日志消息以保持可调试性。\n\n> ⚠️ 已识别出整体风险，但无法提取行内评论，请参考整体评估。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-24T15:54:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-24T16:01:24+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181534298,"discussion_id":"7bd391076192c9cdd240050606445cf7ffaab37c","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| activation | ✅ [*苏跃明*](https://gitcode.com/su-yueming), [*王星*](https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001) (2/2) | ✅ [*苏跃明*](https://gitcode.com/su-yueming), [*王星*](https://gitcode.com/wang-xing001) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n ligen75, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits hav